  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEheeG-unOQiZq4XXiN2bltsXO5CmPF4YxbAtP7f1qhvZqamqpZGvYG4Li5_LTsWiolA9FZYgxAfMWkpht09_T5MA6l636uzoKu1NtUjAx2xNdLNLjxqi0ZkJWIOrVh7B3YY3-U4toYc_4yS44-pxP4VP-R1wgKp3uUTdMItShCpt0MsTFEXWXuTAz2o1uQ/s1536/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2015,%202025,%2007_32_33%20PM.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"אריה שואג - עם כיפה ומגן דוד\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1536\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEheeG-unOQiZq4XXiN2bltsXO5CmPF4YxbAtP7f1qhvZqamqpZGvYG4Li5_LTsWiolA9FZYgxAfMWkpht09_T5MA6l636uzoKu1NtUjAx2xNdLNLjxqi0ZkJWIOrVh7B3YY3-U4toYc_4yS44-pxP4VP-R1wgKp3uUTdMItShCpt0MsTFEXWXuTAz2o1uQ/w213-h320/ChatGPT%20Image%20Jun%2015,%202025,%2007_32_33%20PM.png\" width=\"213\" /></a></div><p></p><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">במדבר פרק כג פסוק כא:</span></h2><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקרא:</span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לֹא הִבִּיט אָוֶן בְּיַעֲקֹב</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְלֹא רָאָה עָמָל בְּיִשְׂרָאֵל</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' אֱלֹקָיו עִמּוֹ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּתְרוּעַת מֶלֶךְ בּוֹ<br /><br /></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ופירושו:</span></h3><p></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ה' מתעלם ולא מביט על חטאי ישראל,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ו(כביכול) אינו רואה את עוונותיהם.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ה' נמצא עם בני ישראל אפילו כאשר הם מכעיסים וממרים את פיו,</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וידידות מלך המלכים (ה') - נתונה לעם לָנֶצַח. (תרועה = ידידות, רעות)</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">במדבר פרק כג פסוק כב:</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקרא:</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵ-ל מוֹצִיאָם מִמִּצְרָיִם</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּתוֹעֲפֹת רְאֵם לוֹ</span></p><p></p><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ופירושו:</span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אתה - בלק - אמרת, שהעם הזה נמלט ממצרים.\nאבל זה לא נכון! ה' הוציאם ברצונו!</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וגאל אותם בעוצמה גבוהה. (ראם - מבטא עוצמה. תועפות - פירושו מָעוֹף גבוה)</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">במדבר פרק כג פסוק כג:</span></h2><p></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקרא:</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">כִּי לֹא נַחַשׁ בְּיַעֲקֹב</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">וְלֹא קֶסֶם בְּיִשְׂרָאֵל</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כָּעֵת יֵאָמֵר לְיַעֲקֹב וּלְיִשְׂרָאֵל מַה פָּעַל אֵל</span></span></p><p></p><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ופירושו:</span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"></p><p></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; color: black; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"></p><p></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הם (ישראל) זכאים לגאולה זו, כיוון שאינם עוסקים בכשפים כמו שאר העמים,</span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וגם אינם עוסקים בקסמים כדי לדעת מה צופן להם העתיד,</span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: right; text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">את העתידות </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הם יודעים ע\"י הנביאים שמוסרים להם את דבר ה'.</span></span></p><p></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">במדבר פרק כג פסוק כד:</span></h2><p></p><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מקרא:</span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הֶן עָם כְּלָבִיא יָקוּם</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וְכַאֲרִי יִתְנַשָּׂא</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לֹא יִשְׁכַּב עַד יֹאכַל טֶרֶף</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְדַם חֲלָלִים יִשְׁתֶּה</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ופירושו:</span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">הרי העם הזה, קם מוקדם בבוקר, כמו לביא אריות, </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">כדי לחטוף ולקיים מצוות,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">וניצב כמו </span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">אריה - ללבוש טלית, לקרוא קריאת שמע ולהניח תפילין.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">לא ילך לישון (בלילה) לפני קריאת שמע של ערבית - הדוחה כל מזיק,</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">ועוד התנבא בלעם, שעתיד משה להרוג את כל מלכי מדין, והוא (בלעם) בתוכם</span><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">.</span></span></p></div>"
}
